    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent. He wants to make his own decisions for as long as he can and to read every record about himself. He named a health care agent and completed a written health care directive today; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. He asked that, if he ever lost capacity, no one be given information about him beyond what his care requires. He wants full treatment for reversible illness and would not want prolonged life support if recovery to an independent life were not expected. He asked that his body be examined after his death if the cause were unclear. The plan will be revisited yearly. [S]</paragraph></text>

